WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.270
Hayate and Freyja's experiments are about to start.

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:06.940
Yeah.

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:10.320
Do you really think it's necessary?

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:17.080
The medical staff from HQ want to confirm that Hayate's rampage wasn't a sign of the initial stage of Var.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:20.690
What about his fold quartz pendant?

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:23.040
I wish I knew.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:27.340
I heard they want to examine Freyja's rune too.

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.300
Is that really okay?

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:38.930
Hayate...

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:40.540
Are you okay now?

00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:45.760
I'm fit as a fiddle!

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:48.060
Let's get these silly experiments over with.

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:53.240
I'll show them that I'm fine even 
with you singing next to me.

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:56.680
So don't be shy and give them an earful.

00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:57.160
Okay?

00:00:58.860 --> 00:01:00.910
Fine. Got it.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:06.940
<i>Our kiss will link us from one end to the other</i>

00:01:06.940 --> 00:01:11.370
<i>Our affection is too hot for mere passionate love</i>

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:16.220
<i>We can be in absolute zero</i>

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:31.020
<i>I'll spark a dream in you</i>

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:35.540
<i>I'll embrace all you believe in</i>

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:38.160
<i>Let your genes go wild</i>

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:45.040
<i>I love you so much, but I try to play it cool sometimes</i>

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:48.890
<i>Tear off my mask and squeeze me to a whole new dimension</i>

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:55.860
<i>Our cores crash into each other, confirming our uncovered love</i>

00:01:55.860 --> 00:02:00.260
<i>The tears we can't cry on our own connect us to the future</i>

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:06.880
<i>Our passionate love will shoot us into a super nova-like state</i>

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:12.770
<i>We can do this! No wounds can hold us back if we're together</i>

00:02:12.770 --> 00:02:15.490
<i>Charm me with your passion, pray to the heavens</i>

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:18.860
<i>Our super big bang will breathe life into a new genesis</i>

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:22.120
<i>We burn our lives for this fusion</i>

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:27.600
<i>We are in absolute zero</i>

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:41.720
Huh? Experiments?

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:43.210
Yes.

00:02:43.210 --> 00:02:45.600
On your resonance with Freyja.

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:47.660
Resonance? But it's happened before.

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:48.730
Why bug us about it now?

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:51.890
Because the circumstances are different.

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:53.690
You know what I'm talking about.

00:02:55.380 --> 00:02:57.420
Is this how you usually fly?

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:00.880
Perception boost.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:05.160
A phenomenon where your brain's 
processing speed accelerates significantly.

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:10.420
Improved sight and hearing and also having your perception of time changed.

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:13.920
Our songs are supposed to suppress that.

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:19.300
If this progresses further and you lose all your self-control, you might turn Var.

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:22.780
Huh? My songs will make Hayate turn Var?

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:25.260
No. It's not your songs.

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:28.270
Then prove that in the lab.

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:40.160
Begin.

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:02.320
Fre-Fre can't sing.

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:04.470
This is getting worse and worse.

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:09.770
Mikumo's not back and Freyja's in this state...

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:12.470
Have you heard anything about Kumo-Kumo?

00:04:14.340 --> 00:04:16.950
I tried asking HQ about her many times, but no dice.

00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:20.280
Switching to a recorded version.

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:26.570
<i>Break the world and go beyond the ecstasy of the past</i>

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:24.160
As if that'd work.

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:33.210
<i>Choose the future even if it's worse than the past</i>

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:34.310
<i>Let's go</i>

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:37.120
<i>Love forever until the very end</i>

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:38.500
<i>Sing so hard until...</i>

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:40.930
What the fuck was that even about?!

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:42.590
Did you prove anything with that?!

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:45.160
Why wouldn't you let Freyja sing?

00:04:45.960 --> 00:04:47.850
It's not that we wouldn't let her.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:51.770
She couldn't sing.

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:55.730
I'm having you take a break for the meanwhile.

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:02.870
Fine.

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:14.200
Telling him not to fly is like clipping off a bird's wings.

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:18.040
Seriously, pilots are such a pain to deal with.

00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:23.140
I just don't want to see it happen again.

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:25.390
Messer...

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:47.620
Fuck this!

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:52.920
I can't believe I made her unable to sing.

00:05:56.750 --> 00:06:00.680
Seriously, how did it ever come to this?

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:04.380
I'm home!

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:07.840
Huh? I'm the only one here.

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:11.430
How's it going?

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:12.830
They're pretty tough.

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:13.760
I see.

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:16.250
But I'll manage.

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:18.600
There's no such thing as an unbreakable lock.

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:26.940
The structures reacted to Walküre's singing.

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:31.210
It felt like that woman... Was Mikumo her name?

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:34.200
Her singing broke the song of the wind.

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:38.560
Walküre hosts a traitor to our nation.

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:39.880
Remember who we're dealing with.

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:42.720
I bet they've researched her rune.

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:45.960
Still, it's nothing but a cheap replica.

00:06:46.690 --> 00:06:51.310
Their research of her rune must be the reason behind the power of their song!

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:53.100
Otherwise His Majesty's song would never—

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:54.260
Just stop there.

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:07.610
Is something wrong, Cassim?

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:09.610
Nothing.

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:14.550
'Tis jellyfish jerky.

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:17.290
It pairs well with apples, or so I hear.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:20.120
Alas, jellyfish does not suit my palate at all.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:21.860
What a shame.

00:07:21.860 --> 00:07:24.000
It's truly a delicacy.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:27.340
How did your talks with the jellyfish eaters go?

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:32.340
I wish I could tell you, but business discretion would not allow that.

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:37.890
The way you dance around things... Perhaps you yourself are a jellyfish?

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:42.190
They might float about gently, but their venom can be quite deadly.

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:45.460
I will take it as a compliment.

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:47.730
Which reminds me of our agreement.

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:51.430
Once the analysis of the Protoculture structure is complete,

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:53.980
we'll begin the mass production of mind control equipment,

00:07:53.980 --> 00:08:02.210
which opens up a whole new market for us, and grants you a new weapon for your war.

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:06.920
But it would appear your intentions have changed.

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:16.990
Greetings, Sir Keith.

00:08:16.990 --> 00:08:19.020
I seem to be interfering with your duties.

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:21.140
Please excuse me.

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:43.660
It's a sauro bird.

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:09.770
Agnus?!

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:35.470
Please forgive our intrusion, Your Majesty.

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:36.640
Are you hurt?

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:41.020
I have never seen Agnus obey anyone but me.

00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:43.850
It is a proud and fearless bird.

00:09:44.070 --> 00:09:45.340
Thank you.

00:09:45.340 --> 00:09:50.650
I forgot that Your Majesty has been beloved by animals all your life.

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:56.500
Even the fiercest snow leopard would purr at your hands like a cat.

00:09:58.010 --> 00:09:59.480
Please excuse my late introduction.

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:01.820
This is my son Normann.

00:10:01.820 --> 00:10:05.120
He recently began work at the castle.

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:07.540
It is my honor to meet you in person, Your Majesty.

00:10:08.350 --> 00:10:11.630
I see a tracker on this sauro bird.

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:13.800
Are you preparing it for the Drachehause?

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:16.460
Yes. That was my intention.

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:19.890
However, the tournament might not be held at all this year.

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:27.860
I see. With the war going on, 
there is no time for sports.

00:10:30.340 --> 00:10:34.700
I wanted to enter the Drachehause one day.

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:37.570
I am sure Your Majesty would show a magnificent hunt.

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:43.030
Your Majesty, how have you been feeling since?

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:44.630
Not bad.

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:48.040
Please excuse me.

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:49.430
Thank you.

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:58.720
Roid, who is that singer on the enemy side?

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:04.470
I felt her song overwhelm my song of the wind.

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:07.920
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:13.230
There is no voice even comparable to yours in the entire galaxy.

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:19.950
Your songs light the runes of Windermereans and lift their wings ever higher.

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:23.410
Please remember that.

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:26.120
I know.

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:33.480
Why is a different doctor attending His Majesty now?

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:36.090
The previous one went home to his family.

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:38.680
His successor is just as skilled.

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:42.050
Sir Keith!

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:44.240
What do you wish of us?

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:48.390
I recall your family does business in medicine.

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:50.800
But of course.

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:54.590
We are traders with the greatest inventory on Windermere!

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:58.120
Is there a lady whose heart you wish to conquer?

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:02.380
Love potions, aphrodisiacs, you name it!

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:04.220
Just say and we'll get it for—

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:05.390
Cut it out.

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:07.080
How may we help you?

00:12:07.610 --> 00:12:09.850
I want you to look into something for me.

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:42.150
Hazing is a bit of a tradition here at the Order.

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:44.190
They got me too.

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:48.620
But you're the first I know to return the favor to the upperclassmen.

00:12:49.610 --> 00:12:51.570
I'm stronger.

00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:53.690
I'd never lose one on one.

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:58.090
I hate people who are weak but use their seniority to demand respect.

00:12:59.620 --> 00:13:00.680
Me too.

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:05.510
I'm Roid Brehm.

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:11.690
I'm—

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:12.760
I know.

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:17.610
Nice to meet you, Keith Aero Windermere.

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:28.280
Roid, where are you flying now?

00:13:50.730 --> 00:13:52.470
Another day, another failure.

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:05.020
Hayate?

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:10.590
Security bypassed.

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:11.470
Good job!

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:14.950
Getting the inner layout of the med ship should be a piece of cake now!

00:14:15.770 --> 00:14:18.160
Time to figure out how to get on board.

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:21.660
Infiltrating that med ship would be pretty tough.

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:25.480
Just leave it to my unparalleled acting and disguise skills!

00:14:27.350 --> 00:14:28.750
Kana-Kana!

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:30.110
Give me a break.

00:14:30.110 --> 00:14:32.490
Do you think they'd let you get away with this?

00:14:32.490 --> 00:14:33.890
They're gonna lock you up again.

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:35.470
I know.

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:38.490
But going the good girls' way wouldn't work.

00:14:38.490 --> 00:14:39.850
We just did it.

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:41.990
We're really worried!

00:14:41.990 --> 00:14:43.360
About Mikumo.

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:46.510
We never know what's on her mind.

00:14:46.510 --> 00:14:49.970
It felt like she hadn't really opened up to us yet.

00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:53.580
Well, it still feels a little bit that way.

00:14:53.970 --> 00:14:59.160
We don't know what Mikumo thinks of us.

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:04.820
But we're friends as Walküre and we've been through so much together!

00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:06.870
Am I not right, Kana-Kana?

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:08.510
We can't just leave her there.

00:15:11.030 --> 00:15:13.430
Please!

00:15:15.570 --> 00:15:17.230
Fine.

00:15:17.230 --> 00:15:20.960
I don't like how they're keeping everything a secret either.

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:22.100
Kana-Kana!

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:41.420
You can't sing?

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:48.150
I told you not to worry about me and just sing with all you've got.

00:15:48.150 --> 00:15:49.130
But...

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:52.630
I told you I'd prove that your songs 
won't make me go berserk.

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:56.760
It's fine.

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:01.480
I'll stop singing.

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:05.240
So you can fly.

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:06.660
Are you nuts?

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:08.980
Do you even know what you're saying?

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:09.940
I do.

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:11.680
No, you don't.

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:13.900
You sing. I'll quit flying.

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:16.280
No! I'll quit!

00:16:16.520 --> 00:16:18.160
No. I'll quit.

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:19.440
I will!

00:16:19.440 --> 00:16:20.060
No, I will!

00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:20.830
I will!

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:21.390
No, I will!

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:22.060
I will!

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:22.880
No, I will!

00:16:27.050 --> 00:16:32.300
Captain Ernest requested that we take in an emergency patient from Elysion.

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:34.080
The symptoms?

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:36.300
Anomaly of bio-fold waves.

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:40.030
Her name's Kaname Buccaneer...

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:42.860
Did the Protoculture structures have an effect on her?

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:45.820
We're past the first checkpoint.

00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:46.440
What's next?

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:52.280
Use the fake test data and medical card to infiltrate ward 3 where we suspect Mikumo is held.

00:16:52.540 --> 00:16:54.430
Roger.

00:16:56.260 --> 00:16:57.700
Good evening.

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:01.780
Clear. Move on.

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:14.970
The security keys get changed at regular intervals!

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:16.850
H-Huh?

00:17:16.850 --> 00:17:17.930
Move.

00:17:18.330 --> 00:17:19.140
Rei-Rei!

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:21.890
So you're saying you don't mind not being able to fly?!

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:23.310
It's not about me.

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:26.010
Is your love for singing that shallow?

00:17:26.010 --> 00:17:27.100
No!

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:29.690
I love singing a lot!

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:31.860
As much I love—

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:36.560
Just cut it out already!

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:37.610
Mirage?

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:42.040
Freyja!

00:17:42.340 --> 00:17:43.250
Yes!

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:47.860
You've come all this way from 
Windermere so you could sing!

00:17:47.860 --> 00:17:50.380
Didn't you make up your mind to stay here and sing

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:53.340
even if that meant fighting your own homeland?

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:54.730
I did, but—

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:56.320
Then sing!

00:17:57.220 --> 00:18:00.250
If you stop singing, what do you have left?

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:01.770
A rune and some apples.

00:18:01.770 --> 00:18:03.050
Am I wrong?

00:18:03.050 --> 00:18:06.100
What happened to that Windermerean spirit of yours?

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:08.990
Now's the time to show what you're capable of!

00:18:08.990 --> 00:18:12.270
Weakling. Coward. Useless apple girl!

00:18:12.490 --> 00:18:13.660
Aren't you going a—

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:15.030
Shut up!

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:16.620
It's your turn now!

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:18.150
You won't fly?

00:18:18.150 --> 00:18:21.300
What do you think you're worth if you refuse to fly?

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:23.910
You couldn't stick to a single job before.

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:26.460
Now that you finally found something that works for you

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:29.450
you want to call it quits when you've invested so much?

00:18:29.450 --> 00:18:32.180
Are you serious? Is that your idea of a joke?

00:18:32.180 --> 00:18:33.930
Are you gonna run off again?

00:18:33.930 --> 00:18:36.380
And bum off who knows where? Is that what you want?

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:38.280
You damn useless wreck of a man!

00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:43.320
Hayate quitting flying...

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:45.160
Freyja quitting singing...

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:47.580
There's no way those things could happen.

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:51.150
You two can't stay like this forever.

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:52.610
Hayate will fly.

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:54.570
Freyja will sing.

00:18:54.920 --> 00:18:57.900
These are things you have to do.

00:18:57.900 --> 00:19:01.320
You don't have a choice.

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:04.160
Why can't you agree to get over this together?

00:19:05.300 --> 00:19:09.840
Freyja, if you're serious about Hayate, you have to sing for his sake!

00:19:10.740 --> 00:19:12.630
And you too, Hayate!

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:17.330
Do you really think Freyja could continue singing if you sacrificed flying for it?

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:24.440
Very well. Then I'll protect both of you.

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:26.260
You two just go back to how you were before.

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:28.320
Big words...

00:19:28.320 --> 00:19:32.780
I'll ask the captain to put you two back on the team.

00:19:33.520 --> 00:19:37.110
Mirage, why would you go that far for us?

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:45.090
B-Because now's not the time to face these type of issues.

00:19:45.090 --> 00:19:48.720
And you're both important comrades to me.

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:52.080
You're irreplaceable... and I love you!

00:19:57.740 --> 00:19:59.940
I'll go see the captain right away.

00:20:12.630 --> 00:20:16.520
"You're irreplaceable... and I love you!"

00:20:18.510 --> 00:20:19.940
Kaname! Break through!

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:23.820
Halt!

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:25.490
You're on your own!

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:29.700
Intruder in ward 3. Intruder in ward 3.

00:20:39.350 --> 00:20:41.050
Is it all over now?

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:46.520
Mikumo?

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:57.650
Answer me, Mikumo!

00:20:57.270 --> 00:21:06.110
<i>Dreams aren't something you have by yourself</i>

00:21:06.110 --> 00:21:14.920
<i>An invisible wind delivers them to you</i>

00:21:09.860 --> 00:21:11.410
Just one left.

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:23.670
<i>If you feel like you can fly high and far,</i>

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:23.300
Mikumo...

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:33.770
<i>don't let go of my hand and hold it tight</i>

00:21:24.040 --> 00:21:25.430
Kumo-Kumo...

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:55.170
<i>I know your blues...</i>

00:21:56.690 --> 00:21:57.580
Mikumo...

00:22:04.820 --> 00:22:06.790
Mission 20: Impulse Experiment

00:22:24.940 --> 00:22:29.990
<i>I stand on the burning wreckage</i>

00:22:29.990 --> 00:22:36.710
<i>I don't know for how long or why at all</i>

00:22:36.710 --> 00:22:41.470
<i>The flames around are drowning me</i>

00:22:41.470 --> 00:22:47.970
<i>Finding what I seek feels so pointless now</i>

00:22:47.970 --> 00:22:53.720
<i>Break the world and go beyond the ecstasy of the past</i>

00:22:53.720 --> 00:23:00.100
<i>Choose the future even if it's worse than the past</i>

00:23:00.100 --> 00:23:01.060
<i>Let's go</i>

00:23:01.060 --> 00:23:04.070
<i>Love forever until the very end</i>

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:06.990
<i>Sing so hard until it hurts</i>

00:23:06.990 --> 00:23:12.780
<i>Until your soul finally settles down</i>

00:23:12.780 --> 00:23:15.690
<i>But if you still want to sing then</i>

00:23:15.690 --> 00:23:18.520
<i>If you want to bet all on living</i>

00:23:18.520 --> 00:23:24.340
<i>The purity of your heart will destroy everything</i>

00:23:24.340 --> 00:23:29.290
<i>Ah, just remember this, baby</i>

00:23:29.290 --> 00:23:36.020
<i>You'll find forgiveness in a chaotic climax</i>

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:39.730
Next time: Yearning Secret
